# ...except the gate self-test's own corpus. `*.al` above exists to keep test
# corpora (BC.History, DC) out of the repo, but tools/gate_selftest.py needs a
# handful of committed AL files to run in CI, where BC.History does not exist.
# Without this negation they are silently untracked, a fresh clone has no
# corpus, and every case that parses AL dies as a harness fault.
!tools/gate-fixtures/al-corpus/*.al
